/**
 * SPORT NUTRITION CLASSROOM — Controlled Synthetic Fixture Runner (TEST)
 * Version: 0.1.0
 * Baseline: DOCS v1.3 / SNC-TEST-FIXTURE-PLAN-001 v1.0
 *
 * SCOPE: Core academic fixture + six synthetic students/enrollments only.
 * Evidence level: HANDLER-LEVEL INTEGRATION (internal application handlers).
 *
 * SAFETY:
 * - Exact TEST environment + spreadsheet identity guard.
 * - No fake LINEAccounts, LINE tokens, push calls, triggers, Drive files, or uploads.
 * - Uses existing active SYSTEM_ADMIN actor context; it does not create/grant admin roles.
 * - Creates Course, Semester, CourseOffering, Users, Enrollments, ImportJob and AuditLogs
 *   through existing application handlers/business validation.
 * - UserIDs and EnrollmentIDs are generated by the application; actual IDs are captured.
 * - No direct application-sheet writes and no automatic cleanup.
 * - Run preflight first. Creation requires the exact confirmation phrase.
 * - Manifest is stored in Script Properties after each successful creation stage.
 *
 * DO NOT run this against Production or any spreadsheet other than the approved TEST ID.
 */

